    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the ending i deserve... that's a heavy thought. everything i've ever done was about saving something, fixing something. now it's just me. and i'm just so incredibly empty. it feels like there's no point in just continuing the cycle of waking up and waiting for the end anyway.",
